source ~/.vimrc

map <c-x> <Action>(QuickJavaDoc)
map <c-S-x> <Action>(ShowErrorDescription)

""" Error navigation
map ]g <Action>(GotoNextError)
map [g <Action>(GotoPreviousError)

""" Git hunk navigation, mirroring vim-gitgutter's default maps in ~/.config/vim/vimrc.
""" IdeaVim can't load vim plugins, so these call IntelliJ's own VCS actions
""" (action IDs verified against the installed IDE).
map ]c <Action>(VcsShowNextChangeMarker)
map [c <Action>(VcsShowPrevChangeMarker)

""" Closest equivalents to gitgutter's <Leader>hp / hu.
map <Leader>hp <Action>(VcsShowCurrentChangeMarker)
map <Leader>hu <Action>(Vcs.RollbackChangedLines)
